<p local-id=3D"a4deebbd34e1">Update <code>QuoteEntitiesMapping</code> so ea=
ch context attribute is populated from the source value listed above.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"fbb056a64564" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-D=
ataSetup">Data Setup</h2>
<p local-id=3D"54772e67467f">Partner pricing model records must be maintain=
ed consistently so the V2 logic can choose the intended model for each line=
.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"1dd2eb9aeb07" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-P=
artnerPricingModelDataRules">Partner Pricing Model Data Rules</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"8=
6e9974f72e9" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"373f9fbe0821">
<th data-local-id=3D"5cd0889df273" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f3e43fdc12d9">Rule</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"4b3d92ab737d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d858011523a5">Expected Setup</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0cd74a4d8860">
<td data-local-id=3D"e9796c36c32c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b7aa222db907"><strong>Model type</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1bc0853124d1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a4414719e897"><code>Model_Type__c</code> must distinguish <c=
ode>Discount</code> from <code>Guaranteed Margin</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9175a6217049">
<td data-local-id=3D"8257cae08855" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3df4c293407d"><strong>Hierarchy level</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"03a53276cbf0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0c04f28d5e5">Normally populate only one hierarchy field on =
each partner pricing model record. Use <code>Solution_Category__c</code>, <=
code>Solution_Group__c</code>, or <code>Unit__c</code> based on how specifi=
c the pricing rule should be.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"75e1661b6ab8">
<td data-local-id=3D"c6470f2c3f38" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3b9854e1a651"><strong>Fallback</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0d4d0d1e0307" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fd7de24f27cf">Leave <code>Unit__c</code>, <code>Solution_Gro=
up__c</code>, and <code>Solution_Category__c</code> blank on fallback model=
 records.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"55f749bc3316">
<td data-local-id=3D"5412996f6d21" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8276989f67e9"><strong>Validity</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d3faf4cdc9e8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f41d1d0b1b64">V2 ignores inactive records, future-dated reco=
rds, and expired records.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"68aea235781c">
<td data-local-id=3D"83af6733e2a7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3f57e5fcdd94"><strong>Duplicates</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"00566478a964" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9190dda37835">The intended design is one valid model per par=
tner, model type, and hierarchy level. If duplicates exist, V2 selects the =
newest created matching record.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"57ff1b0f76b0" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-R=
untimeBehavior">Runtime Behavior</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d4317420d0b0">
<li local-id=3D"0c1eacbe7355">
<p local-id=3D"2a7bbf5125e0">Read the quote's selected <code>Partner_Pricin=
g_Model__c</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"42bf5836523d">
<p local-id=3D"22983a2f9d43">Read the quote's <code>Deal_Type__c</code>.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"beaa21900c62">
<p local-id=3D"054270fda3b1">Load valid candidate partner pricing model rec=
ords for the participating partner accounts.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"056b0ecb7e30">
<p local-id=3D"333345e3995e">For each quote line, use <code>Unit__c</code>,=
 <code>Solution_Group__c</code>, and <code>Solution_Category__c</code> from=
 <code>SalesTransactionItem</code> to select the best matching model record=
.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8bab27e68976">
<p local-id=3D"94d53a0eb3b5">Choose either the standard percentage fields o=
r the <code>Non_Orig_*</code> percentage fields based on deal type.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"face5269cde3">
<p local-id=3D"5f85f8c352f7">Calculate the partner-adjusted price and write=
 the result back to the pricing context.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"13de294a1ce4">
<p local-id=3D"ceddda0f400b">Continue pricing without error when a partner =
has no applicable model for a line.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;">
<h3 local-id=3D"f1d5255c24ea" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-D=
iscountModel">Discount Model</h3>
<p local-id=3D"23f954560202">Only the billing partner's selected model cont=
ributes a percentage. If no model is found, the line receives no partner di=
scount.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #70A59A;">
<h3 local-id=3D"328ac3443a7e" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-G=
uaranteedMarginModel">Guaranteed Margin Model</h3>
<p local-id=3D"2cf27f718796">Each participating partner can contribute a po=
sitive margin. Missing partner models contribute 0 percent.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h2 local-id=3D"dfad53d919ec" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-A=
ctivation">Activation</h2>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EBDBC1;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EBDBC1;">
<p local-id=3D"d4ff12da6544"><strong>Required cutover step</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"852d7a6764db">In DP2, partner pricing is executed from the r=
egional pricing prehook. The DP2 cutover is a one-line Apex change in that =
chain.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"c7a3cd60f5cb" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-D=
P2CutoverDetail">DP2 Cutover Detail</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"c=
0020cdb112b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d6e1e8773b30">
<th data-local-id=3D"f3b5a237ce81" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2691d741477c">Area</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"3dc89ce066ba" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6825b0c980d8">DP2 Cutover Detail</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"030a263c788d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f59b59f4ef5f">Required Change</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4db9968a5c61">
<td data-local-id=3D"a249d76ee3d9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"78ebb95700d5">Regional pricing chain</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"72b3ed797627" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c97b4fd3b22e">File: <code>src/classes/RegionalServicesPricin=
gPrehook.cls</code></p>
<p local-id=3D"d4c89a28f50c">Method: <code>executePartnerPricing(RevSignali=
ng.TransactionRequest request)</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b654ecaab0dc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3fb84f56d991">Replace <code>PartnerPricingPrehook partnerHoo=
k =3D new PartnerPricingPrehook();</code> with <code>PartnerPricingPrehookV=
2 partnerHook =3D new PartnerPricingPrehookV2();</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"870b501fa2bd" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-D=
P2CodeChange">DP2 Code Change</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">// Befo=
re
PartnerPricingPrehook partnerHook =3D new PartnerPricingPrehook();

// After
PartnerPricingPrehookV2 partnerHook =3D new PartnerPricingPrehookV2();</pre=
>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"cb14ba3310a7" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-V=
alidation">Validation</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"8b59b80e2bbf" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-R=
eleaseChecklist">Release Checklist</h3>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"2843213986">
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"1"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Conf=
irm all new fields exist on <code>Partner_Pricing_Model__c</code>.</span></=
li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"2"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Conf=
irm the quote-pricing context definition contains the required <code>SalesT=
ransactionItem</code> attributes.</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"3"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Conf=
irm context mapping populates <code>Fortra_Product_Type__c</code>, <code>Un=
it__c</code>, <code>Solution_Group__c</code>, and <code>Solution_Category__=
c</code> correctly.</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"4"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Conf=
irm <code>Deal_Type__c</code> is available on <code>SalesTransaction</code>=
.</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"5"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Conf=
irm partner pricing model records are populated with the intended hierarchy=
 level and discount fields.</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"6"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Conf=
irm the cutover plan routes runtime pricing to V2.</span></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"b764f18be0dd" id=3D"PartnerPricingV2:BusinessRequirements-R=
ecommendedUATScenarios">Recommended UAT Scenarios</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"4=
e63649dde1f" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"356fbe8a86a6">
<th data-local-id=3D"d3a82c73e0be" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f97e7e54a6c6">Scenario</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"59f1bb8868b3" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0f39f0dc9837">Expected Result</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"affd727ceea2">
<td data-local-id=3D"a2b41777f69d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ba2772242ed1">Discount model with a Solution Category match<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"529fcb26ee95" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"04326c828083">The category-level model is selected for the q=
uote line.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"40a3251ad78f">
<td data-local-id=3D"f47f99907111" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0cc3dc90d77a">Discount model with no category match but a So=
lution Group match</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d6db7f3b8725" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"892927fc8bfa">The group-level model is selected.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1c70535c18d3">
<td data-local-id=3D"1416b744b2cc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c691b3b5d3f">Discount model with no category or group match=
 but a Unit match</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d097bfd028c6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f3ea757112e8">The unit-level model is selected.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"eff858263e6e">
<td data-local-id=3D"a894a061fc3a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"254ec701f5b7">Discount model with only a blank fallback mode=
l</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bb51f1f057f6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4dac6b76d05c">The blank fallback model is selected.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"199d3060874a">
<td data-local-id=3D"0814b158d9d4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ab395ee145df">Discount model with no applicable model</p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"1f60e00ab948" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"65b5f5193e27">No partner discount is applied and pricing con=
tinues.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1db84a6577c6">
<td data-local-id=3D"87d2b40ce4f3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"16a2a6670efd">Fortra-originated deal</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"95753bb901a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"764b6766ccb1">V2 uses the applicable <code>Non_Orig_*</code>=
 percentage field.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0fd720b315a0">
<td data-local-id=3D"147f17c150ae" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c12e7d4b8623">Non-Fortra-originated deal</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e15b870d5c45" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e208f3b0a9c2">V2 uses the standard percentage field.</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a8cbf28484f3">
<td data-local-id=3D"eb68b1942b55" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8d7b668de0fa">Guaranteed Margin with multiple partner roles<=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ae504c5879a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6ebb72f1162d">Valid partner percentages are added together, =
and missing partner models contribute 0 percent.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c18da4d49bac">
<td data-local-id=3D"1a432d80bab1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ecdfaa695350">Expired or future-dated model</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c509f6139c13" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e7a4df1db162">The model is ignored during candidate selectio=
n.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
